  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>새로 개발한 자판기 설계도 만들기 활동입니다. 암석 뿐만 아니라 다양한 수업에 응용 가능할 것 같네요. 우선 암석 자판기 만들기 활동 부터 시작합니다.<br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D6%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20180410135223&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile278.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F992E77485ACC42EF27B76F')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 암석자판기만들기(조암광물이용).hwp</a></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">조암광물로 이루어진 암석 수업을 하고 있다. 그런데 화강암에 석영,장석,운모가 들어있는지 관심 없는 학생들이 많다. 그래서 좀더 생각해 보게 할 수 있는 활동이 뭐가 있을까 고민하다가 자판기 생각을 하게 되었다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리는 조암광물을 이용한 암석 자판기를 설계해야 한다.<br>자판기를 설계하는 과정에서 조암광물이 화성암뿐만 아니라 퇴적암, 변성암도 포함되어 있다는 것과 암석의 생성과정까지 함께 생각해 볼 수 있으면 좋겠다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠별로 설명서를 나눠 주고 3쪽에 있는 학습지는 모둠이나 개인별로 작성하게 하면 된다. 조금 수준이 높은 학생들은 자판기 설계도를 주지 말고 상황만 제시한 다음에 자판기 설계도 부터 본인들이 창의적으로 그려보게 하면 좋을 것 같다. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&lt;암석 자판기 만들기&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">특허청에 심사를 받기 위해 암석 자판기를 만들었다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그런데 특허청에서 자판기 작동원리를 정확하게 설명하지 않으면 특허를 내 주지 않겠다고 한다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">여러분은 지금부터 우리가 만든 자판기의 작동원리를 암석이 뭔지도 모르는 초등학생도 쉽게 이해할 수 있게 설명서를 작성해 주기 바란다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">그리고 판매될때를 대비해서 우리 제품의 특징과 우수성도 적어 주기 바란다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">재료 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">석영</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">장석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">흑운모</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">각섬석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">휘석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">감람석 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가 가능</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자신만의 재료 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개까지 추가 가능</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제품 버튼을 누르면 커피자판기처럼 필요한 재료들이 조합되어 제조과정을 거쳐 암석이 만들어져 나와야 함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -52.9pt; margin-left: 52.9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제조과정 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제시된 제조과정 이외에 필요에 따라 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개까지 추가할 수 있음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -153.7pt; margin-left: 153.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">판매제품 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">화강암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">현무암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">역암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">사암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">셰일</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">),</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">편마암 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">+ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">추가암석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">자신만의 판매제품 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개까지 추가 가능</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -153.7pt; margin-left: 153.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교과서에 나와 있는 다른 암석을 만들어도 되고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세상에 존재하지 않는 자신만의 암석을 만들어도 됨</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제품 가격 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가격책정이유</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(100</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">원</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-800</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">원사이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">다른 자판기 판매제품과 차별화되는 우리제품만의 특징등이 포함되어야 함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">각각의 버튼에 대한 자세한 설명서를 만들어야 함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -153.7pt; margin-left: 153.7pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">설명서에 포함되야 할 사항 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: (</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">몇번버튼</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">을 누르면 어떤 재료들이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">재료</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">재료의 양</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤 제조 과정을 거쳐</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제조 순서는 뒷번호가 먼저와도 되고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">반복 사용해도 됨</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">어떤암석</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">판매제품</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 만들어지는지 적을 것</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -52.9pt; margin-left: 52.9pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) 1</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">번 버튼을 누르면 어떤 재료들이 어떻게 섞이고 어떤 과정을 거쳐서 제품이 만들어져 나옴</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가격은 얼마 이유는 제조과정이 복잡한지</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">녹였다 식힐때는 빨리 식혀야 하는지 등등 제품이 만들어지는 과정을 자세하게 설명</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리제품을 구매해야 하는 이유는 타 제품에 비해 이런 점</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제조과정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">또는 그 암석이 가지고 있는 특성이 잘 나타남</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이 우수함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -52.9pt; clear: none; margin-left: 52.9pt; float: none; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 630px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"475\" style=\"height: auto; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/99C8E54E5ACC41670E\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\" filename=\"사용자 지정 7.png\" srcset=\"//img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1920x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile21.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99C8E54E5ACC41670E4E1C 1920w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R960x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile21.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99C8E54E5ACC41670E4E1C 960w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R720x0/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile21.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99C8E54E5ACC41670E4E1C 720w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R640x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile21.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99C8E54E5ACC41670E4E1C 640w, //img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R480x0.q70/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile21.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F99C8E54E5ACC41670E4E1C 480w\"></span></p><p><br><br>출처: <a href=\"http://sciencelove.com/2254\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">http://sciencelove.com/2254</font></u></a> [김정식 허명성의 과학사랑]<br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
